# .claude-plugin/ (marketplace.json) and claude-plugin/ (the Claude Code plugin:
# agents/commands/skills + its own .claude-plugin/plugin.json) are committed,
# emitted output (WI-5a, D33) and are deliberately NOT excluded here: vsce
# packages them into the VSIX as-is (confirmed by the §14.3 S9 spike), so the
# installed extension folder can double as a Claude Code plugin marketplace.
